IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RVV-GGUF-Q4.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-BLOCKS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 VECTOR-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 STRIDE-REDUCTION    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RVV-GGUF.
    IF TOTAL-BLOCKS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 88 TO STRIDE-REDUCTION.
    MOVE 245 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
